	(text "FIG 6C J15 channel: NO values are printed for any R/C, and the second op-amp stage\nhas no refs at all (named 6C_R?n / 6C_C?n / 6C_U?1 here). The R73/R80 node, the U20\nand 6C_U?1 second outputs go to off-page connectors with NO names printed; the\n6C_U?1 output and 6C_R?4 right end are lines that just end. Local names used."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 381 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "04b69eb0-813d-5cb2-a70c-1641a0c97976")
	)
	(text "MOUNTING HOLES (drawn on FIG 6C, not placed as parts):\n  MH9, MH10, MH11, MH12, MH13, MH14, MH15 - all joined (dots) and tied to GND\n  MH1, MH4, MH5, MH6 - each drawn with an open lead (no connection)\n  MH2, MH3, MH7, MH8 are not shown."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 381 292.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2ea5bd4e-7f64-5998-93d0-52d815138dac")
	)
	(text "J10 pins 17 and 19: arrows pointing away (left), pins 18 and 20: arrows pointing\naway (right) - no names printed. Pin 16 printed N/C. Pins 21-24 tied to GND.\nCFT_T2 (pin 25) and CFT_T1 (pin 26) are wire names, not connector symbols;\nthey cross the GND loop without a junction dot."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 254 254 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2f702e6a-784d-57b9-972a-b01b4560ae05")
	)
